    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Lean `TrailingStopOrderRegressionAlgorithm.py`。`add_equity(\"SPY\")`；`buy_trailing_amount=2`，`sell_trailing_amount=0.5`，`trailing_as_percentage=False`。无买单票据时 `trailing_stop_order(+100, trailing_amount=2)`；组合已投资且无卖单票据时 `trailing_stop_order(−100, trailing_amount=0.5)`。断言止损价须始终落在相对前一根低/高的 trailing 距离内，且买成交价≥止损、卖成交价≤止损。不是止损限价 EMA30/60 核（W561），也不是仅 TrailingStopRisk 风控叠层核。提出日期未知。SPY追踪止损买$2/卖$0.5（非%）≠ 止损限价EMA30/60（M3368）/仅TrailingStopRisk风控叠层。计入美股/ETF。提出日期按源文件原样保留未知。"
    },
